  "body": "Set on a generous approximately 444sqm section with an impressive floor area of approximately 227.5sqm, this substantial residence offers 4 well-proportioned bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and multiple living spaces across two thoughtfully designed levels. Combining generous proportions with excellent flexibility, the home is ideally suited to large families, extended family living, or those seeking additional space for guests. Backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, it provides peace of mind for years to come.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n-The ground floor's versatility is a thoughtfully designed granny potential, features a spacious bedroom,  a family bathroom, complemented by a separate sitting room. This well-positioned space provides excellent flexibility for extended family, guests, teenagers, or those seeking a degree of independence.\r\n-The upper level forms the main hub of the home, with a generous open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area designed for both everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n-A spacious walk-in pantry provides valuable additional storage and preparation space, helping keep the main kitchen organised and clutter-free.\r\n-The spacious master bedroom provides a peaceful private sanctuary, complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and its own ensuite.\r\n-Two further well-sized bedrooms share a modern family bathroom with a bathtub, creating a practical and private accommodation zone for children or guests.\r\n-Secure double garage provides convenient internal access together with valuable space for storage and everyday family needs.\r\n\r\nLocated close to Stanmore Bay Beach and within easy reach of Whangaparaoa shopping amenities, cafés, schools, and everyday conveniences, the address supports both lifestyle and practicality. The forthcoming Penlink motorway link is set to further improve connectivity to SH1 and central Auckland.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
